{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>דמי יזרעאל</b> — They are the house of Ahab. Concerning the house of Jehu, that he did not follow fully after HaShem, also Jehoahaz his son and Jehoash son of his son, also this Jeroboam, also Zechariah his son — all of them did evil in the eyes of YHWH, for so it is written."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:42.103054880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}